	<text xml:lang="la">
		<body>
			<div>
				<p>
					<s n="1" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z1"/>S.</s>
					<s n="2" xml:lang="la">Heri sub noctem me ab aedibus absente cursor noster, <lb xml:id="p1z2"/>qui consilium nostrum de disciplina ad vos detulit, reversus <lb xml:id="p1z3"/>est, et tuas attulit, ex quibus tamen non intelligo quid senatui <lb xml:id="p1z4"/>respondeatis.</s>
					<s n="3" xml:lang="la">Suspicor tamen suspendi a vobis responsum.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="4" xml:lang="la">In<lb xml:id="p1z5"/>terea rogo, ut et prius, ut vestram interponatis apud <lb xml:id="p1z6"/>nostros authoritatem.</s>
					<s n="5" xml:lang="la">Ea enim plurimum poterit, si intelligant <lb xml:id="p1z7"/>vos nobiscum sentire.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="6" xml:lang="la">Velim interea d. <persName ref="p540">Calvinum</persName> <lb xml:id="p1z8"/>quoque consentire: sed hoc ipsum tu quoque tua efficies authoritate.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="7" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z9"/>Nostrorum alias plaerisque ita exosus est, ut ingratum sit illis quicquid <lb xml:id="p1z10"/>ab eo proficiscatur.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="8" xml:lang="la" ana="salute">Non dubito tamen quin ipse pro sua pietate et <lb xml:id="p1z11"/>prudentia propter gloriam domini et ecclesiarum salutem hoc facile <lb xml:id="p1z12"/>dissimulaturus sit.</s>
					<s n="9" xml:lang="la">Committo omnia tuę prudentię et oro do<lb xml:id="p1z13"/>minum, ut is omnia optime disponat et ad foelicem finem <lb xml:id="p1z14"/>deducat.</s>
					<s n="10" xml:lang="la">Sane perquam utile esset statui a vobis solidum aliquid, <lb xml:id="p1z15"/>quod posteritas sequeretur; alias, si a vobis, clarissimis ecclesię <lb xml:id="p1z16"/>et seculi nostri luminibus res indecisa ad posteros transmittatur, <lb xml:id="p1z17"/>maximas prospicio turbas orituras.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="11" xml:lang="la">Scio quidem, quid de hac <lb xml:id="p1z18"/>materia et d. <persName ref="p8111">Martyr</persName> et d. <persName ref="p540">Calvinus</persName>, <persName ref="p3429">Viretus</persName> item, <persName ref="p467">Bucerus</persName> <lb xml:id="p1z19"/>et alii scribant; sed aliud est simpliciter scribere et aliud rem in <lb xml:id="p1z20"/>effectum deducere.</s>
					<s n="12" xml:lang="la">Occurrunt enim tam multae difficultates, <lb xml:id="p1z21"/>tam varii casus, ut velim viam ita sterni, ut tollerabilis <lb xml:id="p1z22"/>et aedificabilis esset modus, in quem consentirent omnes quemque <lb xml:id="p1z23"/>omnis sequerentur, quamvis non ignoro non posse eandem formam in <lb xml:id="p1z24"/>omnibus ecclesiis servari, sed pro earum diversitate et commoditate <lb xml:id="p1z25"/>agendum, quod semper aedificabile fuerit.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="13" xml:lang="la">Sunt tamen communia quaedam, <lb xml:id="p1z26"/>quae conciliari poterant.</s>
					<s n="14" xml:lang="de">Ich sag sonst, <foreign xml:lang="la">si ex corde dicendum e<lb xml:id="p1z27"/>st,</foreign> wir plätzind an eir sach die talig ins werch kon werde, <lb xml:id="p1z28"/>und werde grad gon wie zuͦ <placeName ref="l28">Basel</placeName>; da ist man lang mitt <lb xml:id="p1z29"/>umbgangen, ist aber pluderm aus hosen.</s>
					<s n="15" xml:lang="la">Haec apud te.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="16" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z30"/><foreign xml:lang="de">Von <placeName ref="l646">Glarus</placeName> schript mir amman <persName ref="p252">Bäldi</persName>:</foreign> Communicavi eas consuli <lb xml:id="p1z31"/>et senatui, et hodie ea de re agetur serio.</s>
					<s n="17" xml:lang="de"><foreign xml:lang="la">Scripserunt in<lb xml:id="p1z32"/>terea nostri iterum ad vestros</foreign> und wettend gern, das man <lb xml:id="p1z33"/>zun sachen thäte; so dunckt uns immer, ir habind lüth, <lb xml:id="p1z34"/>die vil zläw sigind.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="18" xml:lang="de">Ich gspüren bi den unseren anders <lb xml:id="p1z35"/>nüt denn das si gern hettind, das man einmal mitt denen <lb xml:id="p1z36"/>lüthen tütsch rette, die da meinend, himmel und erden stand <lb xml:id="p1z37"/>an inen.</s>
					<s n="19" xml:lang="de">Nun weiß ich wol, das an üch nüt erwinnt; <lb xml:id="p1z38"/>aber wo es fäl, weiß ich auch wol.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="20" xml:lang="de">Gott bessere es.</s>
					<s n="21" xml:lang="de">Amen.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="22" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z39"/>Haec raptim et festinantissime.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="23" xml:lang="la">Proinde ignosce.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="24" xml:lang="la" ana="salute">Salutem <lb xml:id="p1z40"/>dicam, quibus iubes.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="25" xml:lang="la" ana="salute">Salutant illi te vicissim.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="26" xml:lang="la" ana="salute">Salutem <lb xml:id="p1z41"/>dic symmystis omnibus, tum quoque uxori et familię.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="27" xml:lang="de"><placeName ref="l41">Bernę</placeName>, <lb xml:id="p1z42"/>20. februarii 62.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="28" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z43"/><persName ref="p8204">Gislingerum</persName><note xml:id="fn1" type="footnote" n="1"><persName ref="p8204">Johannes Gislinger</persName>.</note> nostrum, qui has affert, <lb xml:id="p1z44"/>tibi commendo.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="29" xml:lang="la">Luit adhuc poenas iuventutis levius trans<lb xml:id="p1z45"/>actae; interea tamen se mediocriter bene gerit.</s>
					<s n="30" xml:lang="la"><persName ref="p8018">I[<lb xml:id="p1z46"/>oannes] H[allerus</persName>] tuus.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="31" xml:lang="la"><pb/><lb xml:id="p2z1"/>Clarissimo viro d. <persName ref="p495">Heinrycho <lb xml:id="p2z2"/>Bullingero</persName>, <placeName ref="l587">Tigurinae</placeName> ecclesiae <lb xml:id="p2z3"/>antistiti fidelissimo, domino <lb xml:id="p2z4"/>suo honorando et compatri ch<lb xml:id="p2z5"/>arissimo.</s>
				</p>
			</div>
